{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52658","headline":"同前 · 孙□","name":"同前","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"（上缺）□□火□修□上罩天□孙（下缺）□□承□妓，香风韵管弦。\n（下缺。\n同前）（按：此下尚有□阳隐士、前西城县尉二人之残诗，□阳隐士诗存：「□□□胜□□履〖下缺〗云□草□空不期□□□□得□□圣〖下缺〗」前西城县尉诗存：「□□地零落□□□□□□□□□殊香〖下缺〗醉□□□□仙□□□曲□□能〖下缺〗」皆已不可读，不另立目，姑附於此。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孙□","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52658.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52658","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}